{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Type of game </h2>Nightmare is a linear, pixelated, side-scrolling story-solving game that takes place in a modern urban setting, interacts with a dark world, numerous NPCs, and photo surveys to accompany you in every case.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511320/extras/852308da8c8917ba2e72b942a8410bdc.avif?t=1612454548\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > A Brief Introduction to the Story </h2>Fisher is an underdog private investigator.He lives in a crime-prone city, often without serious commissions, and scrapes by doing tedious work such as investigating infidelity and searching for lost pets.<br>One day, a high-spending client came to Fisher's door and entrusted him with investigating a burglary.<br>Rich clients, flawed criminals, easy evidence...As the investigation deepens, Fisher gradually detects a number of suspicious things in the seemingly simple commission, which leads to the discovery of an unknown murder.<br>A bizarre late-night dream takes Fischer into an incredible world.Here, he reincarnates the beast, returns and the reality is very different homicide scene, finally found the homicide truth the last piece of the puzzle.<br>Despite failing to find his client's stolen property, Fisher managed to pull off a perfect case.When he congratulates the dream for providing him with clues, he does not know that the dream world's conspiracy is also in the air, intent to devour what is left of his righteous soul...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Features </h2><strong> Game Actions </strong><br>In a semi-open world, players will use <strong> to search the scene, analyze objects, and question NPCs to obtain evidence </strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511320/extras/1b8c88cf7fa1a84d276a74e8c0bedf61.avif?t=1612454548\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511320/extras/200afc48f5ea9445f6249fb5b38a6230.avif?t=1612454548\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><strong> Correct the prisoner </strong><br>Use the <strong> evidence </strong> you get to expose the lies the criminal tells and uncover the truth behind it!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511320/extras/d21bdd01494097e0f306f5518b69d844.avif?t=1612454548\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511320/extras/e54cbcb7b367c22c69a681fe0db088a7.avif?t=1612454548\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><strong> The World Outside </strong><br>In the inner world you will become a leopard, in the <strong> dark world </strong> to discover something unknown ~<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511320/extras/70968ccd14e1a94e9bb911aadba9849e.avif?t=1612454548\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511320/extras/82430657b3bfa3250baf8ac807ca77c3.avif?t=1612454548\" width=600 height=338 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1511320?t=1612454548","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1511320?t=1612454548","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511320/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1612454548","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511320/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1612454548","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"F